4,0,,status,Daisuke,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""SEER"",""alive"":true}"
5,0,1,talk,Daisuke,,Um... hello. I'm Daisuke. I'll do my best... but I'm not very good at this.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Victoria,,Hello. I am Victoria. I believe we should prioritize observing behavioral patterns and contradictions over hasty accusations.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Shunichi,,"How formal, Victoria. I'm Shunichi. I'll be watching to see who tries too hard to look ""rational"" while hiding something.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Takumi,,"I'm Takumi! I don't care about fancy strategies. If you're acting sketchy, I'll find you and call you out!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Ryuji,,I am Ryuji. I agree with Victoria. A logical approach is the only way to minimize errors in our deductions.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Daisuke,,I... I agree. Maybe we should be careful about who speaks first... so the werewolf doesn't know who to target?,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Victoria,,"That is a valid point, Daisuke. However, silence can also be a mask. We need a balance of information and caution.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Daisuke, your hesitation is almost endearing. But hiding in the shadows is a luxury the Werewolf already enjoys, isn't it?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"Stop picking on him, Shunichi! I trust people who are honest about being nervous more than people who act all cool.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Ryuji,,"Emotion is an unreliable metric, Takumi. We should focus on the consistency of claims once the Seer provides information.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Daisuke,,Sorry... I just don't want to make a mistake. I'll try to listen carefully to everyone.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Victoria,,I am curious if the Seer will choose to reveal themselves early or stay hidden to protect their identity.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Shunichi,,Revealing yourself early is a death wish. Only a fool or a very desperate person would do that this soon.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Takumi,,I'd do it if it meant saving my friends! Bravery is what we need to win this thing!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Ryuji,,Bravery without a plan is merely recklessness. The Seer's survival is paramount to the village's victory.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think I understand. I'll just... keep observing for now.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Daisuke,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Victoria,,I have noted everyone's initial tone. I will look for shifts in these attitudes tomorrow.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Victoria,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Shunichi,,This has been a delightful little introduction. I'm already seeing some very predictable patterns.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
25,0,4,talk,Takumi,,Whatever! I'm ready for tomorrow. Let's just find the wolf and get this over with!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
26,0,4,talk,Ryuji,,Let us proceed with caution. I will analyze the voting patterns tomorrow to identify any hidden alliances.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
27,0,,action,Daisuke,Ryuji,WEREWOLF,"{""action"":""divine"",""result"":""WEREWOLF"",""valid"":true,""raw"":"" Ryuji (human)""}"
