33,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,Um... I... I have some information. I think... I think Ryuji is the werewolf.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"@Daisuke, that is a very bold claim for someone who was so hesitant yesterday. What is your basis?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Oh, look at that. Our shy little lamb has suddenly found his voice. How convenient for the village, or perhaps... for someone else?","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"Whoa! Daisuke, you're actually speaking up! I like that! If you say it's Ryuji, I'm listening!","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"@Daisuke, your accusation lacks any logical foundation. You have provided no evidence, only a feeling. That is not a deduction.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I'm the Seer. I checked Ryuji last night... and it was... it was a werewolf. I'm sorry, but it's true.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"If Daisuke is the Seer, the situation is clear. However, a Werewolf often claims the Seer role to frame a human.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"Exactly. A ""nervous"" persona is a classic cover. @Daisuke, you're playing the ""unlikely hero"" role a bit too perfectly, don't you think?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"Shut up, Shunichi! Daisuke was shaking yesterday! He wouldn't lie like that. I trust him! Ryuji, you're the wolf!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Daisuke"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,It is a simple play. The Werewolf claims to be the Seer to eliminate a neutral party. Daisuke's sudden confidence is highly suspicious.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I'm not... I'm not playing a role. I was scared, but I can't let the wolf stay. Please... believe me.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Ryuji, your defense is purely logical, but it doesn't disprove the divination. @Daisuke, why did you wait until now to speak?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,Because he wanted to see who would react first. It's a calculated move. I find it far more likely that Daisuke is the wolf.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Takumi,,You're just trying to confuse us! Daisuke is being brave right now. That's how I know he's telling the truth!,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"Trusting ""bravery"" over logic is why villages lose. If we execute me based on a lie, we lose a human and the wolf remains.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I... I really am the Seer. I don't want anyone else to die... please vote for Ryuji.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Victoria,,"I have observed the reactions. Ryuji is calm, but Daisuke's vulnerability feels authentic. I will trust the Seer's claim.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,"How disappointing. You're all falling for the simplest act in the book. Fine, vote however you like. I've seen enough.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Takumi,,"I'm with Daisuke! Ryuji, you're going down! I don't care what your ""logic"" says!","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,"It is regrettable that this group prefers emotion over reason. I will accept the vote, but the village will pay for this error.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
